Article 44

1. The implementation of services for women and children victims of violence shall be carried out in an integrated manner by the PPT.
2. The PPT as referred to in paragraph (1) is an integrated part and constitutes one unit with the PPT that provides integrated services for witnesses and/or victims of the crime of trafficking in persons.
